      "var": "remaining_size",
      "code": "remaining_size = max_len - actual_length - 2 * sizeof(*local_memory);",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "The code computes remaining_size after the copy-size calculation without first requiring actual_length to fit within the bytes remaining after the option header."
